.Dd August 7, 2026
.Dt EBS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm ebs
.Nd build .xpt packages from ebs formulae
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Aq Ar command
.Op Ar args
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a shell script that parses
.Xr ebs 5
formulae scripts
and executes them to build
.Xr xpt 8
binary packages.
.Nm
is part of ebt build tools
.Pq Nm ebt .
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm help
print usage information to the screen.
.It Cm build
build an
.Xr xpt 8
package from a
.Xr ebs 5
formula.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mkfhs 1 ,
.Xr rig 1 ,
.Xr libxpt 3 ,
.Xr ebs 5 ,
.Xr xpt.index 5 ,
.Xr xpt.manifest 5 ,
.Xr xpt.tree 5 ,
.Xr ecw 8 ,
.Xr xpt 8
